# Files that must never be served as static files on the deployed site.
#
# The two buyer files (promptdrawer.md, promptdrawer.html), the prompt sources in
# prompts/, the tooling and the internal docs are kept out of the deployment, so
# there is no public URL that hands the product over. The pack reaches a buyer
# only through api/download.js, which carries its own compiled copy of both files
# (see tools/build_pack.py) and refuses to serve a byte of them unless Stripe
# reports the checkout session as paid.
#
# vercel.json repeats this protection at the routing layer with explicit 404s, so
# the two mechanisms cover for each other. Do not remove either one.
promptdrawer.md
promptdrawer.html
prompts/
tools/
docs/
tests/
README.md
